otifs: headphones, a small star in the night sky, windows, the night sky\n\nPlease include his silver ring necklace.\n\nIf possible, I would like an illustration with a dark atmosphere that highlights Xi's loneliness and complacency or his fear and anxiety. I would also like him to have a slightly troubled expression. All the other details (pose, location, outfit) I leave up to sensei!", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 70945, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "augermaid", "screen_name": "maderobo145", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1774635491289374720/85NJYZIu.jpg", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 25, "complete_expiration_days": 28, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 160}, {"id": 1082675, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "\u308f\u3086@\u3084\u307e\u3060", "screen_name": "wayuyuwa_wayu", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1377528923576131586/rF7s5PGV.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1130015262139228160/1613216342/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 0}, {"id": 2590674, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "\u3051\u306b\u3043\uff20skeb\u3067\u30ea\u30af\u30a8\u30b9\u30c8\u52df\u96c6\u4e2d", "screen_name": "KennyMuseum", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1753421452207169536/QL2C0-5l.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1211622859744763906/170688323